### Summary Cheat Sheet

| Situation | Command |
| --- | --- |
| **Combine separate histories** | `git merge origin/master --allow-unrelated-histories` |
| **Remove folder from Cloud only** | `git rm -r --cached [folder_name]` |
| **Check identity for "Greens"** | `git config user.email` |
| **Sync local with Cloud** | `git fetch origin` |

